{
  "schema": "csaf-uikit-theme/1",
  "id": "codex-pages",
  "name": "Codex Pages",
  "note": "Kit 11 (2026-10-24): a book and journal theme. Oxblood leather bands around parchment pages, a gilt book-corner guard over every corner of the heavy frames (geometry.corner \"guard\", new in the generator: a right triangle with an engraved fillet and a stud, the way metal corners shield an old ledger), ink-blue bookcloth for the main actions, wax-seal crimson for danger. geometry.book adds the book set: a left and a right page whose cover rim and stacked page edges sit in the outer margins and whose gutter sits in the inner margin (two side by side are a spread at any size), a cover-opening strip (closed, lifting, edge-on, falling, open) and a page-turn strip (six frames), four ribbon bookmarks, three paper index tabs, a quest-log entry, four ink stamps, a wax seal, a quill cursor, a chapter heading, a flourish divider, a page-number cartouche, an illuminated drop-cap frame and three book icons. Every text-on-fill pair is re-measured by the gate.",
